<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom futures to start June 20.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom futures to start June 20.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in a futures contract on Portugal Telecom shares will start on the Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) on June 20, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>It will be the first individual stock to have a futures contract. The exchange currently trades futures on the PSI20 stock index.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
